      "id": 1,
      "text": "Port Sanilac began as a lumberjack settlement called Bark Shanty, where early sawmills, a schoolhouse, and a general store first appeared.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
